---
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '')
const year = new Date().getFullYear()
---

<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="relative max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-10">

    <!-- Logo grande in cima al footer -->
    <div class="border-b border-white/7 pb-10 mb-10">
      <a href={`${base}/`} class="block hover:opacity-80 transition-opacity duration-200 inline-block">
        <img src={`${base}/logo_arsolving.svg`} alt="ARSOLVING" class="footer-logo-img" />
      </a>
      <p class="mt-5 text-white/36 text-[0.9rem] leading-[1.8] max-w-lg">
        Qualsiasi problema — operativo, digitale, logistico, commerciale.
        ARSOLVING lo risolve. Oggi, non domani.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Command row -->
    <div class="footer-command">
      <div>
        <div class="section-label mb-4">Avvia analisi</div>
        <h2>Hai un problema? Chiamaci.</h2>
      </div>
      <a href={`${base}/contatti/`}>Raccontaci il problema</a>
    </div>

    <!-- Columns -->
    <div class="footer-main">

      <nav class="footer-nav" aria-label="Navigazione">
        <span>Navigazione</span>
        <a href={`${base}/`}>Home</a>
        <a href={`${base}/#interventi`}>Interventi</a>
        <a href={`${base}/#arsolv`}>Metodo</a>
        <a href={`${base}/il-gruppo/`}>Il Gruppo</a>
      </nav>

      <div class="footer-nav">
        <span>Aree</span>
        <a href={`${base}/services/`}>Operativa</a>
        <a href={`${base}/digital/`}>Digitale</a>
        <a href={`${base}/projects/`}>Strategica</a>
      </div>

      <div class="footer-contact">
        <span>Contatto</span>
        <a href="mailto:info@arsolving.com">info@arsolving.com</a>
        <p>Operativa, digitale, strategica o mista — descrivi il problema, il resto è nostro.</p>
      </div>

    </div>

    <div class="footer-bottom">
      <p>© {year} ARSOLVING. Tutti i diritti riservati.</p>
      <p>Solved Path. Premium Solutions.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
.footer-logo-img {
  display: block;
  height: 72px;
  width: auto;
}
</style>
